<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>FinKit</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
    <main class="landing-page">

        <section class="hero-section">
            <div class="hero-content">
                <p class="brand-label">FinKit</p>
                <h1>FinKit — Your Personal Finance & Investment Management Platform</h1>
                <h2>Your Finance Bestfriend</h2>
                <p class="hero-description">
                    FinKit is a full-stack personal finance management platform designed to help
                    users take control of their money and make smarter financial decisions.
                    Users can track their income and expenses, manage budgets, monitor savings
                    goals, and visualize their financial activity through interactive dashboards
                    and reports.
                </p>
                <p class="hero-description">
                    The platform allows users to organize transactions into categories, with
                    support for both manual categorization and smart category suggestions.
                </p>

                <div class="action-buttons">
                    <form method="GET" action="/finkit/sipcalculator">
                        <button type="submit" class="secondary-btn">SIP Calculator</button>
                    </form>
                    <form method="GET" action="/finkit/emicalculator">
                        <button type="submit" class="secondary-btn">EMI Calculator</button>
                    </form>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="dashboard-preview">
                <img src="/images/Screenshot 2026-08-31 191643.png" alt="FinKit Dashboard Preview">
            </div>
        </section>

        <section class="difference-section" id="difference-section">
            <p class="section-label">WHY IT'S DIFFERENT</p>
            <h2>Built to clarify, not to overwhelm.</h2>
            <p>
                Most finance apps drown you in numbers. MyFinanceTools does the ranking for you,
                so you always know the one thing to do next.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="auth-actions">
            <form method="GET" action="/finkit/login">
                <button type="submit" class="primary-btn">Login</button>
            </form>
            <form method="GET" action="/finkit/signup">
                <button type="submit" class="outline-btn">Sign Up</button>
            </form>
        </section>

    </main>
</body>
</html>
